cff-version: 1.2.0
message: 若本仓库对你的研究有帮助，请按下列方式引用。
# 主题名用英文：这份数据集随英文论文投国际期刊，引用它的文献列表也是英文。
# 中文题名作为译名保留在 Zenodo 记录的 Additional titles（Translated title）里，
# CFF 只支持单一 title，故以英文为准。2026-09-27 与 Zenodo 一并改，DOI 未变。
title: "Valuation Tearing and Deep Drawdowns: A Leading Measure and a Three-Layer Decision System for China's A-Share AI Economy (frozen datasets and construction code)"
abstract: >-
  Frozen datasets and construction code released alongside the paper of the
  same name. The data span 642 trading days from 2024-01-01 to 2026-08-26 and
  include the ledger of 12 deep drawdown episodes, the daily series of the
  three decision quantities, the valuation tearing series (gap) between
  technology and traditional industries, the industry-level drawdown and
  return series behind the panel test with its results, and the calibration of
  every threshold. The code is the implementation that constructs these
  quantities. The repository supports verification-level reproduction: every
  number printed in the paper can be recomputed from the released data by
  reproduce.py and compared item by item.
type: dataset
